{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-07", "pageid": 134679, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-06\" title=\"春日迟-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-08\" title=\"春日迟-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E6.8F.A1.E6.89.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一握手\">一握手</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一握手</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Hand She Held</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——只需如此吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>师姐将法剑插回鞘中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，别看啦，这不是什么复杂的法术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>可是刚才结阵的法子好威风！师姐，能不能也教教我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>你入门时间太短，尚未完全掌握我派心法，哪怕学了也空有架势，疏导不了凝滞的气脉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>再过十年吧。以你的天分，届时应已小有所成，学阵法定然会事半功倍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>万一在此之前，我有什么用得着这法子的地方呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>叫我或者师父师兄们帮忙便是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那，万一我独自在外行走呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>师姐摇头失笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我看你是觉得新鲜有趣，才想试试吧？世上新鲜东西这么多，还不够你玩的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>再等等吧。十年很短的，只消跟着师父做十轮正月的法事，也就到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>十年还短呀！要做三千余次早课晚课，念三千余遍《北斗经》呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>——我们鹭鸶剪毕竟还小呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>不过十年而已。你现在觉得漫长，往后回想起来，恐怕会觉得短如瞬息吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>即便如此，那也是以后的事！眼下看来，这就是很长的时间啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>唉，鹭鸶剪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>师父还没来得及同你说，他打算日后把我派的两柄长生法剑传给你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>长生……长生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>你知道何为长生吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>我派众人修习内丹术，寿数原本就比常人要长上许多。而你……你天资那么好，难得心性又与我派心法相宜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>所以，你会有比我们所有人更漫长的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……只有我吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那，你们呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你，你还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>是我不对，不该提起你的伤心事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杏花树下，原本闭目凝神的鹭鸶剪略显困惑地睁开眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？我很好，倒是你怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>从刚才到现在，你都绕着我转了好几个圈了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你一动不动，是在睹物思人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我确实在看这阵法，也确实在回想从前的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这便算是睹物思人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……我觉得，你好像有些伤心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>是吗？我……我只是在思考破解之法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我原本想回忆当时的情境，无奈记性实在太差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>睹物思人……你说得对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我该想想，师姐是怎样的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不，我该感受感受，她当年是如何布下法阵的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人将手掌轻轻放在干枯的树干上，重新闭上眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世上有些事如大道周行，譬如四季轮回、天分禀赋，以及城镇的兴衰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也有另一些事，是须弥芥子。譬如杏花的颜色。春风。简单的手诀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>譬如，握一只熟悉的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——找到了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:133%\">——她握住了那只手。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>同样的术法，她用得总比旁人更精准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><span style=\"text-align:left\">——她的天资并不算高，只能求诸于术。</span></i><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>引导气脉时，她习惯留一个口子，以便修正。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:right\">——她思虑最周全，所以才能打理白马派上下事务。</span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314116.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314116.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-314116.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314116.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>她……也擅长体察气的流动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><br /><br /><br /><i>——她最心细，最关心周围的一切。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>再让我多想起一些吧。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_22\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_22\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_4_bg_22.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_22.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措已经低头盯着脚下一小块枯草发了许久的呆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到骡子慢悠悠地踱过来啃食草根，她才心不在焉地摸了摸它的耳朵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你也觉得她看着有些伤心吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-642601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">骡子：</div><div>——咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>唉，都是我不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>等我们回去，我向老丈赔个不是，好不好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>大不了，再到别处想想办法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一片花瓣落在枯草上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬头望去，眼前是不可思议的一幕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>荒草正在由灰黄转为嫩绿。而就在草丛正中，那株垂死的杏树骤然焕发生机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大片大片的杏花叠满枝头，盛放着压坠枝梢，如一道灿烂的花瀑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵江风吹来，又轻又薄的花瓣纷纷扬扬落下，像最轻柔的雪花，沾上衣襟便会融化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措伸手接住一瓣。花瓣生机勃勃，带着微卷的弧度，润泽而饱满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-647114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>杏花……？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_07\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_4_at_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从来没有过这样离奇的事，从来没有过这样多的花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛过去两百年里的杏花都在同一刻盛开，仿佛两百多个春天同时来临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杏花树下，鹭鸶剪抚摸着虬结的树干。她随身带着的白玉长剑不知何时出了鞘，莹莹的剑气在周身缠绕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>这……这是怎么回事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，这可是棵交了好运的杏花树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>它的气蕴没完全断绝，气脉一旦畅通，这些年积攒的生机就会迸发出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪抬头仰望一树杏花，阿措看不见她的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>真漂亮啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你想到修补的法子了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不过，我把原先的法阵毁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>把原先的法阵毁了……原来还有这个办法。我怎么没想到？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>不，我连其中的气如何运转都看不明白，就算想到了，也不知要怎么做……鹭鸶剪，你好厉害！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>未必做不到。我不是说了嘛，这阵法不难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>只是，这可能是我师姐在世上留下的最后一样东西了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>——你师姐留下的，最后一样东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿措愣愣地重复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，的确是她的手笔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>那，你、你就这么把它……毁了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>这阵法须每两百年加固一次，可如今世上已经没有知晓加固之法的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哪怕勉强留它在此，再过些年也自会消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你放心，我已用宗门法剑重新梳理了气脉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>以后就算无人疏导，也不会出事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>你是说，从此这里的气脉再不会凝滞？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>正是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿措：</div><div>那，原先的法阵，也就此消失，一点痕迹都不会留下吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>花瓣纷纷扬扬，落在阿措的头发上、肩膀上，也落在鹭鸶剪摊开的手心里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-314118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪 ：</div><div>是啊，什么都不会留下。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-07"}}